      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. could u expand on the ventilation part? like, if there's a leak or a small ignition in one of those middle racks, how does that affect the spread compared to a standard open floor layout? i'm trying to understand the 'invisible' mechanics of how a fire gets out of control so fast in these setups.",
